        <mxCell id="audit_box" parent="1" value="&lt;div style='line-height:1.6; font-family: Segoe UI, sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#c9d1d9;'&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style='color:#3fb950;'&gt;✔ 100% Indian Market Specialization:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Equities:&lt;/b&gt; NSE (.NS) and BSE (.BO)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Indices:&lt;/b&gt; Nifty 50 (^NSEI), Bank Nifty (^NSEBANK), Sensex (^BSESN)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Derivatives:&lt;/b&gt; Weekly/Monthly Index &amp; Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;ADRs:&lt;/b&gt; INFY.US, WIT.US, HDB.US, IBN.US&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0; border-top:1px solid #30363d;'/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style='color:#f85149;'&gt;✖ 0% Foreign Market Clutter:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Purged 18 Foreign Brokers:&lt;/b&gt; Alpaca, Binance, eToro, Futu, IBKR, KIS, Longbridge, MT5, OKX, Robinhood, Tiger, Toss, Upbit, etc.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Purged 24 Foreign Loaders:&lt;/b&gt; Tushare, Baostock, Eastmoney, Sina, Tencent, Pykrx, Gildata, etc.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Purged Unused Channels:&lt;/b&gt; WeChat, DingTalk, Feishu, QQ, Matrix, Mochat, MSTeams&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cleaned UI Locales:&lt;/b&gt; Removed 8 foreign languages; clean single-language English UI&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr style='border:0; border-top:1px solid #30363d;'/&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style='color:#d29922;'&gt;⚡ Performance &amp; Reliability:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Single-Commit Fresh History in GitHub&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Zero Token Bloat from Foreign Tool Declarations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;100% Quant Math &amp; Alpha Formulas Preserved&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0d1117;strokeColor=#21262d;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" vertex="1">
